ds and pack buffers, and staged publication and invalidation. W41 observes transient icon manifest and PNG sources, publishes complete PNGs and verifies OpenGL upload state and codec retirement. W42 joins the live creature and item cache records, item fingerprints and state, and shares each of the two preview renderers across its actual routes. Next join cold status catalog and shared creature/item visual assets and their GPU caches, then close remaining filesystem, decoder stack and driver terms. Preserve the W40 service and W41 codec evidence. Include cold status catalog and visual cache construction as separate source owners. Preserve native tab and recovery behavior. Continue with other actual overlays and callbacks. Account shared renderer, shader and text roots through existing owner census. Unknown or externally-supplied objects remain open. Then complete all actual world/pool/input/OS-thread domains, escaped and detached owners, process-exit, window/capture service/GLFW and unpinned E11 construction. CRT per-thread parameter storage and per-thread data, retained loader layers, kernel handles, directory iterator opening and advance peaks, shared CRT slot and locale ownership, exception and system costs remain open. Logger cold init/rollback,historical main30344 remainder,VLOG/site/symbolizer/signal/utility roots,cleaner scans,stdio/CRT/locale/ exception/stack/TLS loader/OS/driver/GPU/total process still need explicit source/platform envelopes. No global asset/ process quota introduced. Complete original matched whole-process/RSS/high-water/frame/performance/memory/native matrix under S6.06/S6.05. S4.02 then S4.03..06/S5/S6 OPEN;23/42 unchanged;ecology S6.05 [-48,-1] data vs [-48,-4] oracle OPEN. Full S0..S6 preserved,no reduced acceptance.",
